{"page":20217,"part":1,"text":"赵松雪\n\n\n或问余宋四家书既不可学，当学何书为得？余曰：「其惟松雪乎！」松雪书用笔圆转，直接二王，施之翰牍，无出其右。前明如祝京兆、文衡山俱出自松雪翁，本朝如姜西溟、汪退俗亦从松雪出来，学之而无弊也。惟碑版之书则不然，碑版之书必学唐人，如欧，储、颜、柳诸家，俱是碑版正宗，其中著一点松雪，便不是碑版体裁矣。譬如清庙明堂，林居野馆，截然两途，岂可浑而一之哉！或曰：「然则何不径学唐人，而必学松雪，何也？」余曰：「吾侪既要学书，碑版翰牍须得兼备，碑版之书其用少，翰牍之书其用多，犹之读三百篇，《国风》、《雅》丶《颂》不可偏废，书道何独不然。」\n","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20217,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"bdfcbdad7a10225db2e5e52f9e28035bb393d281154db30a76fc131d7bfee713","textSha256":"bdfcbdad7a10225db2e5e52f9e28035bb393d281154db30a76fc131d7bfee713","fileSha256":"bdfcbdad7a10225db2e5e52f9e28035bb393d281154db30a76fc131d7bfee713","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20217-work-149.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"书学 · 赵松雪","sourceUrl":"","originalPages":[637],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"ccffe6e9e7b125bb15559f1cbb4c6252273f62e7686967bb7262280bb3e9cec4","id":"local-637-6-10","page_id":637,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":6,"rawEnd":10,"reviewedTextSha256":"f8494333f78bcd4dc6c560b82caa5db9ce89068a7af14438218f067c9fb66524","displayUnitOrigins":[[6,7],[7,8],[8,9],[9,10]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":637,"part":3,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"宋品宣","verifiedAt":"2026-10-20T08:59:37.136Z","revision":"f8494333f78bcd4dc6c560b82caa5db9ce89068a7af14438218f067c9fb66524","textSha256":"f8494333f78bcd4dc6c560b82caa5db9ce89068a7af14438218f067c9fb66524","fileSha256":"5e3a8e126438f8956a4f6192ae403b5c724c1b67665b9c18af94841661f1f0de","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/batch-02/extracted/member-3-part-3/第3份-